  "url": "/ShowUserReviews-g255097-d20860981-r970921738-Hobart_City_Apartments-Hobart_Greater_Hobart_Tasmania.html",
  "title": "Safe ,affordable, clean, Motel to start a family Journey. Central to most places in Hobart.",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "This apartment was exactly what myself and my family needed. \nWe have 3 Teens and it was space enough to just relax and chill. \nWe loved the location central to major shops including Myer, a great Mall to miander through and just look there are a variety of cafes and shopping exsperiances to do. \n\nWe have a big Ute so parking was ok just a little tighter but managed well.\nThe reception was amazing and the rooms were 100% clean and fresh. \nBeds were very comfortable and pillows amazing. \nThere was laundry area I could use which helped heaps it was card access only \"if you want to wash\".\nThis apartment serviced our needs for amenities like microwave toaster and bar fridge.  \nWe brought our own breakfast items and some snacks so it can keep some cost down if you like , but there were many cafes and places that could accommodate if you required. \nWe walked to the Salamanca market only 10 mins down the road and felt very safe. \nWe will definitely be booking again when we venture this way. \nWe are from Victoria near Cobram so it was a wonderful holiday for our family.  Hope this review helps others.",
  "username": "kategW9248IY",
  "connectionToSubject": null,
  "absoluteUrl": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g255097-d20860981-r970921738-Hobart_City_Apartments-Hobart_Greater_Hobart_Tasmania.html",
