  "title": "Perfect place for a weekend stay",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "Everything about our stay at Hobart City Apartments was fantastic. The delightful Ping assisted initially with booking multiple rooms for our group stay.\nWe were welcomed warmly and the staff were great to deal with. \nWe stayed in the 3 bedroom penthouse and it was brilliant! High ceilings, comfy beds, all amenities as advertised.\nThe location was great - quick walk to supermarkets and restaurants, 10min downhill stroll to the harbour.\nWould absolutely stay here again",
