  "url": "/ShowUserReviews-g255097-d20860981-r878603958-Hobart_City_Apartments-Hobart_Greater_Hobart_Tasmania.html",
  "title": "Very disappointed",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "The only good things about this place was the free washing machine for guests. \nIt was centrally located however that’s where it stops. Our room smelt musty, the shower leaked, room was not serviced. We stayed for 8 nights and I had to request a sheet change. \nThe cleaners didn’t clean the toilet or shower the whole time we were there. \nThe dust that was on the floor when we arrived was just pushed around. \nThe saucepans in the cupboard were filthy with dried on food from previous guests. Our windows were dirty with a dried on bird poo down the middle of it. \nVery disappointing snd not cheap $2800 for 8 night’s accommodation. \nWe wouldn’t stay here ever again and would not recommend. ",
